      "css": ".ds-term{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;align-items:center;gap:14px;min-height:92px;padding:16px;background:var(--control,#e4ded3);color:var(--ink,#111b2b);border:2px solid transparent;text-align:left;font-family:var(--font,\"General Sans\",Arial,sans-serif);cursor:pointer}.ds-term[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--selected,#f0ddbf);border-color:var(--orange,#f47a18)}.ds-term:hover{background:var(--selected,#f0ddbf)}.ds-term:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange,#f47a18);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-choice{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}.ds-choice i{display:grid;place-items:center;flex:0 0 24px;width:22px;height:22px;border:1px solid #80715e;border-radius:50%}.ds-term[aria-pressed=true] i{border-color:var(--ink,#111b2b)}.ds-term[aria-pressed=true] i::after{content:\"\";width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink,#111b2b)}.ds-term strong{font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600}.ds-term small{display:block;font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.4;color:var(--warm-quiet,#49433c);margin-top:5px}.ds-term>b{font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}@media(max-width:600px){.ds-term{min-height:84px;padding:14px 10px;gap:8px}.ds-term strong,.ds-term>b{font-size:1rem}.ds-choice{gap:8px}.ds-choice i{flex-basis:20px}}",
      "description": "Controle semanal com indicador circular e aria-pressed; diária equivalente fica na cotação abaixo."
    },
    {
      "name": "Cotação do plano",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "quote",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-quote\" role=\"status\"><p><strong>R$ 55,70</strong> /dia*</p><div>Pagamento de R$ 389,90 por semana</div><small>Minha Moto · 36 meses</small><small>*Semana dividida por 7, para comparar. A cobrança é semanal.</small></div>",
      "css": ".ds-quote{background:var(--charcoal,#18222d);color:var(--white,#fff);padding:24px 26px;font-family:var(--font,\"General Sans\",Arial,sans-serif)}.ds-quote p{margin:0;display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:baseline;font-size:1.25rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-quote strong{font-size:2.75rem;letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.12}.ds-quote>div{font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;margin-top:10px}.ds-quote small{display:block;font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.5;color:var(--quote-muted,#eadfce);margin-top:8px}.ds-quote small:last-child{margin-top:12px;max-width:48ch}@media(max-width:600px){.ds-quote{padding:22px 20px}.ds-quote strong{font-size:2.5rem}}",
      "description": "Superfície carvão para diária equivalente com semana e condição visíveis; não é diária avulsa."
